  m_text: "On any spin, 3 or more          triggers Mystery Wheel Feature.\r\nWhen
    triggered, reels expand to 4x5 and 2 lowest symbols are removed from the Wheel
    Strip.\r\nThen, whenever one or more          added on new row, expand reels by
    one row and remove 2 lowest symbols from the Wheel Strip.\r\nIf the reel set is
    7x5 or no extra          appears, then start to spin the Wheel.\r\nEvery          is
    replaced with the symbol from the Wheel. "
